@attribute [Route($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Inputs}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Overview}")]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Inputs @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview</PageTitle>

<section class="@GlobalValues.Info_Box_Class @GlobalValues.Info_Box_Coloured_Modifier">
    <h1 class="@GlobalValues.Info_Box_Heading_Class">@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Inputs @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview</h1>

<p>
    The proceeding Input components all have the same structure and approach with regard to accessibility. Each Input component is a complete unit that is comprised of a label for the accessible name, an area
    below the label for optional hint text. the input control itself that allows for an optional leading icon, with a fixed trailing icon used to display the validity of the inputs value (a green tick for valid or a red cross
    for invalid) with the appropriate ARIA attributes for screen reader users. Beneath the input is an area for validation messages which are displayed in an unordered list.
</p>
<p>
    All of the Input components make use of the <span class="code-span">aria-describedby</span> attribute to link the the optional hint text to the input, with validation error messages being linked in the same manor if configured to do so.
    None of the Input components use ARIA live regions although some combinations of screen reader and browsers treat <span class="code-span">aria-describedby</span> in a similar manor to live regions.
</p>
 
<p>
    All of the inputs are contained within the NuGet package <b>BlazorRamp.Inputs</b>, released version <b>v1.1.0</b> See the documentation site for more information: 
    <a target="_blank" class="@GlobalValues.Link_Class" href="@GlobalValues.Site_Link_Docs_Inputs">Inputs documentation (opens in new window)</a>
</p>


</section>

<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Busy}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Quirks_Issues}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Busy - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Quirks_Issues</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_Inputs}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Quirks_Issues}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Inputs - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Quirks_Issues</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>


